WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.205
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.305 --> 00:01.305
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

3
00:01.305 --> 00:02.335
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

4
00:02.335 --> 00:03.475
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

5
00:11.615 --> 00:13.645
(Episode 24)

6
00:15.815 --> 00:18.755
I forgot to take this out last night.

7
00:19.755 --> 00:21.395
Where did you find this?

8
00:21.955 --> 00:23.895
It is the nicest thing we have in the house.

9
00:23.955 --> 00:26.025
Why did you shove it in the corner of the sink?

10
00:29.465 --> 00:30.965
Is it because your mother gave it to you?

11
00:32.935 --> 00:34.735
I heard it from that old lady you work for.

12
00:35.975 --> 00:37.305
She hid the fact that she is your mother...

13
00:37.375 --> 00:38.745
and just dumped it on you.

14
00:39.375 --> 00:41.245
Does she think she is some kind of secret agent?

15
00:41.645 --> 00:42.715
That darn woman.

16
00:47.385 --> 00:48.915
The Ms. Hong I told you about...

17
00:49.985 --> 00:51.115
I do not think it is going well.

18
00:52.355 --> 00:54.625
Looking closely, she is not the real deal either.

19
00:55.195 --> 00:56.695
She just stuffed her face with kimchi.

20
01:00.195 --> 01:02.495
Carrying around that awful lunchbox must be why.

21
01:03.635 --> 01:04.635
Gosh.

22
01:06.535 --> 01:07.935
Even if we end things,

23
01:09.135 --> 01:11.445
I am definitely going to eat longtooth grouper before it is over.

24
01:23.485 --> 01:25.955
It's a waiver of assets, inheritance, and gifts.

25
01:28.325 --> 01:30.355
I do not know what might happen to me,

26
01:30.755 --> 01:32.795
so I want to make sure everything is legally sound.

27
01:35.835 --> 01:38.765
Stocks, real estate, savings, instalment savings, and cash.

28
01:39.265 --> 01:41.835
You are giving up everything that could be inherited by you.

29
01:44.005 --> 01:45.375
From this moment on,

30
01:45.605 --> 01:47.645
management rights, family business succession,

31
01:47.945 --> 01:49.815
demands for executive positions in the family business,

32
01:50.445 --> 01:51.885
and any claims to assets...

33
01:52.415 --> 01:53.815
under your parents' names...

34
01:53.885 --> 01:55.215
This memorandum states you forfeit all of it.

35
01:56.055 --> 01:57.085
Mother.

36
01:57.815 --> 01:59.085
Please sign here.

37
02:01.325 --> 02:02.725
From now on, the company management...

38
02:03.355 --> 02:04.825
will be succeeded by Yoon Jin.

39
02:05.625 --> 02:06.625
Chairman Hong.

40
02:07.365 --> 02:08.365
Okay.

41
02:08.435 --> 02:10.435
I won't give you even a penny, even if you starve to death.

42
02:11.865 --> 02:12.865
I understand.

43
02:15.205 --> 02:16.975
I will not ask for anything else.

44
02:19.705 --> 02:21.415
Just make me a meal when I visit home.

45
02:23.215 --> 02:25.545
You have only walked on red carpets since you were born,

46
02:27.045 --> 02:30.185
so you do not know the mud pit. Only those who have walked...

47
02:30.685 --> 02:32.825
the gravel field and the mud pit can handle them. You cannot.

48
02:35.125 --> 02:36.625
That is how I raised you.

49
02:37.355 --> 02:39.495
You have experienced the best the world has to offer,

50
02:39.565 --> 02:40.565
so you know...

51
02:42.595 --> 02:44.195
You will be crying tears of blood soon...

52
02:44.265 --> 02:46.005
because you want to return to the carpet.

53
02:48.075 --> 02:49.475
Life on the carpet.

54
02:50.535 --> 02:52.845
Thanks to you, Mother, I have experienced it all.

55
02:53.275 --> 02:54.375
I know it all,

56
02:55.145 --> 02:56.615
so I actually have no regrets.

57
02:57.175 --> 03:00.215
The mud pit, the gravel field, I am not afraid of them at all.

58
03:00.585 --> 03:03.315
I know exactly what I need to do to be happy, Mother.

59
03:04.255 --> 03:06.825
Do you think Han Gyu Rim feels the same?

60
03:09.795 --> 03:13.295
She probably thought dating you was her ticket to the carpet.

61
03:13.865 --> 03:16.235
Do you think she can hold onto a penniless beggar like you...

62
03:17.465 --> 03:20.135
as tightly as she does now and still love you?

63
03:24.635 --> 03:28.775
Even if we walk a gravel field or mud pit worse than this,

64
03:30.145 --> 03:32.645
she will never let go of my hand. Gyu Rim will not.

65
03:33.845 --> 03:34.855
Want to bet?

66
03:46.065 --> 03:49.595
(Notice: Closed for one week for interior renovations)

67
03:51.705 --> 03:53.135
Are you here, ma'am?

68
03:53.905 --> 03:55.605
Could you come to the kitchen?

69
03:56.405 --> 03:58.705
When you come, there is a container for the radish kimchi.

70
03:58.775 --> 04:00.175
Please bring that with you.

71
04:10.655 --> 04:12.285
I am so hungry, Gyu Rim.

72
04:14.555 --> 04:16.455
Can you please eat with me?

73
04:47.425 --> 04:48.595
You already had breakfast, right?

74
04:49.195 --> 04:50.595
But still, have at least one bite.

75
04:51.095 --> 04:52.625
The hangover soup here is absolutely amazing.

76
04:55.365 --> 04:57.535
Did you drink a lot at the reunion yesterday?

77
04:59.665 --> 05:01.335
Why do you look so rough?

78
05:03.805 --> 05:04.805
I do, right?

79
05:05.105 --> 05:06.845
I look like I am on the verge of death today, right?

80
05:09.475 --> 05:11.345
Did something happen? Are you sick?

81
05:14.955 --> 05:16.985
I am so happy and thrilled...

82
05:17.555 --> 05:19.255
that I am on the verge of death right now.

83
05:23.125 --> 05:26.395
My mother gave us her permission to date.

84
05:28.025 --> 05:29.095
You are lying.

85
05:30.435 --> 05:34.135
- Why would I lie about that? - No. How did this happen so fast?

86
05:34.935 --> 05:37.075
You said it would take some time.

87
05:37.905 --> 05:39.405
I thought it would take some time too,

88
05:39.805 --> 05:41.645
but things just worked out this way.

89
05:42.775 --> 05:44.245
I even reconciled with my mother.

90
05:44.475 --> 05:46.615
She said she will cook for us if we visit.

91
05:50.755 --> 05:52.655
So from now on, let us really...

92
05:53.485 --> 05:55.525
love each other to the fullest. Okay?

93
05:56.295 --> 05:58.265
If your feelings for me are at 100 percent,

94
05:58.565 --> 05:59.765
express all of them. Okay?

95
05:59.825 --> 06:02.035
Do not hold back, do not hide anything,

96
06:02.135 --> 06:03.335
and do not leave anything out.

97
06:04.165 --> 06:05.165
Got it?

98
06:37.635 --> 06:38.835
Gyu Young.

99
06:39.635 --> 06:40.635
Han Gyu Young.

100
06:42.105 --> 06:44.405
How did you end up here?

101
06:50.715 --> 06:52.715
Kang Sung Wook, you scamming bastard.

102
06:54.645 --> 06:57.755
Kang Sung Wook, you scamming bastard!

103
07:13.265 --> 07:17.305
I am truly at a complete loss for words.

104
07:19.345 --> 07:21.875
So you are telling me that you did that...

105
07:21.945 --> 07:24.475
to that crazy girl?

106
07:25.385 --> 07:26.385
That is right.

107
07:27.515 --> 07:31.925
I did not know my finger strength was that powerful either. Okay?

108
07:32.485 --> 07:34.455
She was acting so obnoxiously,

109
07:34.525 --> 07:36.795
so I just flicked her on the forehead exactly one time.

110
07:37.355 --> 07:39.565
But she just instantly passed out.

111
07:40.095 --> 07:41.295
When she came to her senses a little later,

112
07:41.365 --> 07:43.035
she looked at me like this,

113
07:43.595 --> 07:46.565
with such clear eyes, and suddenly...

114
07:47.465 --> 07:49.935
she asked, "Who are you?"

115
07:50.005 --> 07:53.375
- It really drove me crazy. - How could a grown man...

116
07:53.445 --> 07:56.215
flick a woman on the forehead so recklessly?

117
07:56.815 --> 07:58.545
You just knocked out six teeth with one punch...

118
07:58.615 --> 08:01.285
and had to pay them settlement money.

119
08:01.715 --> 08:02.985
You know exactly how heavy your fists are,

120
08:03.055 --> 08:05.155
so did you already forget?

121
08:05.755 --> 08:08.395
That is why if I go to the police station this time,

122
08:08.455 --> 08:10.655
I will really have to wear handcuffs.

123
08:11.595 --> 08:13.525
So I could not contact her family...

124
08:13.695 --> 08:15.595
and just brought her to our house for now.

125
08:15.695 --> 08:18.335
You should just wear the handcuffs, you punk.

126
08:19.465 --> 08:21.235
Do you think I can live in the same house as you...

127
08:21.305 --> 08:23.775
when I am terrified you might hit me too?

128
08:24.735 --> 08:28.205
Which finger was it? I am going to snap it right off.

129
08:28.275 --> 08:32.645
- Show me which finger it was. - Gosh, just snap them all off.

130
08:32.845 --> 08:34.785
If snapping my fingers would solve this,

131
08:34.845 --> 08:36.555
I would snap them 100 times.

132
08:37.715 --> 08:39.985
I am scared of myself too, Mom.

133
08:41.085 --> 08:45.295
An enemy from a past life is born as your child in this one.

134
08:46.125 --> 08:47.765
An enemy from a past life.

135
08:50.265 --> 08:54.105
But when we went to the hospital, the doctor said...

136
08:54.865 --> 08:59.545
it is just temporary amnesia caused by the strong impact.

137
09:00.005 --> 09:02.645
In a month at the latest, her memory will come back,

138
09:02.715 --> 09:03.945
so he told me not to worry too much.

139
09:05.485 --> 09:08.385
That is a relief.

140
09:09.555 --> 09:11.655
- So what now? - What?

141
09:12.485 --> 09:13.785
What are you going to do?

142
09:13.925 --> 09:15.995
Are you just going to keep that crazy girl...

143
09:16.055 --> 09:17.755
here in the house like this?

144
09:18.495 --> 09:21.835
Just until her memory comes back. Okay?

145
09:22.235 --> 09:25.235
It will be a month at the latest. She could even get it back tonight,

146
09:25.505 --> 09:29.175
- or tomorrow, right? - Will her husband's family...

147
09:29.235 --> 09:30.805
not be looking for her?

148
09:33.075 --> 09:34.675
Well, her husband's family...

149
09:34.745 --> 09:37.215
thinks she is on a business trip to the US, so that is fine.

150
09:38.175 --> 09:40.985
But we absolutely cannot tell Gyu Rim's family.

151
09:41.315 --> 09:43.255
If Gyu Rim finds out I did that to Gyu Young,

152
09:43.315 --> 09:46.555
she will pass out on the spot. And especially Gyu Young's father...

153
09:46.985 --> 09:49.225
Just thinking about him is terrifying.

154
09:49.995 --> 09:51.325
If Han Seok Joong finds out,

155
09:51.395 --> 09:53.895
you will bleed from both ears that very day...

156
09:53.965 --> 09:58.705
and just wither away and die. Do you think I am an idiot?

157
09:58.935 --> 09:59.935
Big sister.

158
10:02.935 --> 10:04.605
Are you awake now?

159
10:04.735 --> 10:07.345
Yes, I'm awake. I'm thirsty, big sister.

160
10:07.545 --> 10:09.775
- Water, get her water. - Right, water.

161
10:10.045 --> 10:13.085
Here. Sit down right here.

162
10:13.085 --> 10:15.385
- Come on, sit down. - Okay.

163
10:17.755 --> 10:20.125
Here, drink some water.

164
10:20.255 --> 10:21.285
Thank you.

165
10:23.225 --> 10:24.325
Who are you?

166
10:25.565 --> 10:26.565
I mean...

167
10:28.295 --> 10:32.105
Who do you think you are?

168
10:34.705 --> 10:35.905
I do not know.

169
10:36.875 --> 10:38.645
How can you not know?

170
10:38.945 --> 10:41.375
Heung Sik's fist is not made of iron,

171
10:41.605 --> 10:43.615
so how could getting flicked on the forehead...

172
10:43.745 --> 10:47.015
make you forget who you are? This is unbelievable.

173
10:47.645 --> 10:49.415
I am so scared. That sister is scary.

174
10:49.485 --> 10:51.715
- Okay. - Sister, my foot.

175
10:51.785 --> 10:52.785
Mom, please.

176
10:52.855 --> 10:53.925
How could I be your older sister?

177
10:54.155 --> 10:56.355
Hey, if my first love had not failed,

178
10:56.425 --> 10:58.925
I would have a grandchild your age.

179
10:59.865 --> 11:03.935
Just call her grandma. You were always rude,

180
11:04.135 --> 11:05.735
so you used to call my mom grandma.

181
11:07.105 --> 11:09.635
That grandma is scary. Tell her to go away.

182
11:09.935 --> 11:12.905
Is this your house? I am in my own house,

183
11:12.975 --> 11:15.375
so who are you to tell me to leave?

184
11:16.215 --> 11:17.645
If she gets more shocked...

185
11:17.715 --> 11:20.385
and her memory never comes back, what are we going to do?

186
11:21.415 --> 11:24.455
Just hurry up and go to the store. Min Guk must be waiting for you.

187
11:25.555 --> 11:27.285
Gosh, forget it.

188
11:27.725 --> 11:30.525
I would rather die than deal with this.

189
11:40.005 --> 11:41.005
She is gone.

190
11:44.775 --> 11:46.845
I told you I did not want to come here.

191
11:47.305 --> 11:48.575
Your mother...

192
11:48.715 --> 11:51.575
already singles me out and hates me so much. Gosh.

193
11:51.945 --> 11:53.445
It is like walking right into a lion's den.

194
11:53.615 --> 11:56.255
Well, did you have anywhere else to go?

195
11:57.515 --> 12:02.255
Just swallow your pride and go back to your family.

196
12:03.395 --> 12:06.665
No matter what you do, the only people who will embrace you...

197
12:06.725 --> 12:08.265
are your family members.

198
12:08.665 --> 12:10.665
I told you I am not going back there.

199
12:10.765 --> 12:13.905
Even if I show the whole world how ruined my life is right now,

200
12:14.465 --> 12:17.305
I cannot show my family. I absolutely cannot.

201
12:23.215 --> 12:24.215
Hey.

202
12:25.245 --> 12:26.885
Your friend called earlier.

203
12:28.185 --> 12:30.915
Su Chan? Yes, yes. Song Su Chan.

204
12:31.115 --> 12:32.855
He said he offered to give you...

205
12:32.985 --> 12:34.985
half the shares of his clothing store,

206
12:35.085 --> 12:36.995
but you turned him down?

207
12:38.125 --> 12:39.695
Su Chan asked me to persuade you.

208
12:40.465 --> 12:41.995
Why are you answering my phone?

209
12:42.195 --> 12:44.435
You punk. Is your father a stranger?

210
12:46.365 --> 12:48.135
Why would you turn that down when you have nothing?

211
12:49.335 --> 12:52.245
You even saved his life, right?

212
12:52.745 --> 12:54.845
If you did something that amazing,

213
12:55.315 --> 12:58.075
getting an entire clothing store would not be enough, man.

214
13:00.145 --> 13:03.415
You will not be young forever.

215
13:04.185 --> 13:06.385
How long will you keep catering to drunks, cleaning up their messes,

216
13:06.555 --> 13:09.155
getting hit by broken bottles, and living your life as a waiter?

217
13:11.025 --> 13:12.025
A waiter?

218
13:13.225 --> 13:14.295
I know.

219
13:15.665 --> 13:18.565
I know you have been working as a waiter to make a living.

220
13:19.605 --> 13:22.775
Back when Gyu Seo mentioned you were doing rough work,

221
13:23.305 --> 13:24.605
I figured it out right away.

222
13:26.575 --> 13:30.145
Even though you are uneducated, you are still a handsome guy...

223
13:30.915 --> 13:32.415
who takes after me,

224
13:32.485 --> 13:34.015
so I figured you were working as a waiter.

225
13:35.755 --> 13:37.185
My friend told me...

226
13:37.855 --> 13:39.425
that a popular waiter...

227
13:39.625 --> 13:42.225
makes way more in tips than their actual salary.

228
13:43.195 --> 13:44.225
So?

229
13:44.995 --> 13:46.395
Because you thought it was tip money,

230
13:46.825 --> 13:49.095
you had absolutely no guilt taking it from me?

231
13:51.235 --> 13:54.265
Come on, of course I felt guilty.

232
13:55.335 --> 13:58.275
It tore me up inside, but I hid it.

233
13:58.675 --> 14:00.005
I did not want to burden you.

234
14:03.145 --> 14:04.875
Anyway, putting that aside,

235
14:05.245 --> 14:07.385
being a clothing store owner is thousands of times better...

236
14:07.445 --> 14:08.815
than being a waiter.

237
14:08.885 --> 14:10.315
I was not a waiter. I was a gigolo.

238
14:12.355 --> 14:13.385
What?

239
14:13.425 --> 14:16.025
A gigolo who seduces women and leeches off them.

240
14:19.925 --> 14:21.665
No matter how much a waiter makes in tips,

241
14:22.035 --> 14:24.665
how could I clean up after your constant messes...

242
14:25.235 --> 14:26.635
and make all that money?

243
14:29.805 --> 14:30.875
Gyu Rim does not know.

244
14:31.905 --> 14:33.105
As long as Gyu Rim does not know, it is fine.

245
14:34.005 --> 14:35.375
Even if the rest of the family knows,

246
14:36.545 --> 14:37.945
as long as Gyu Rim does not know, it is fine.

247
14:57.065 --> 14:58.435
My eldest son is a gigolo?

248
15:02.835 --> 15:04.435
The money he made as a gigolo, I...

249
15:11.615 --> 15:12.715
And as his father, I...

250
15:18.925 --> 15:20.185
Here, open wide.

251
15:23.955 --> 15:24.955
Okay.

252
15:27.065 --> 15:28.195
It tastes even better.

253
15:32.535 --> 15:34.435
I think you got a text.

254
15:35.405 --> 15:38.335
It is fine. I will check it after I finish feeding you.

255
15:41.605 --> 15:42.675
Here, another bite.

256
15:44.745 --> 15:47.485
I am going to work after I eat,

257
15:47.685 --> 15:49.385
so do not worry about me and go do your work.

258
15:49.485 --> 15:51.155
Where are you going in this condition?

259
15:52.055 --> 15:53.485
I am telling you, I am fine. Really.

260
15:55.255 --> 15:57.155
- Hoon Tae. - Honey.

261
15:58.825 --> 16:00.565
Being here with you like this,

262
16:01.795 --> 16:05.465
it just makes me want to hold onto you forever.

263
16:08.465 --> 16:09.935
To tell you not to go anywhere...

264
16:11.135 --> 16:12.475
and to stay by my side.

265
16:14.505 --> 16:15.545
I will do better.

266
16:17.445 --> 16:19.015
I will do so much better than I am doing now.

267
16:20.415 --> 16:24.485
So, can you not just let me hold onto you this once?

268
16:30.455 --> 16:31.855
You are so unlucky.

269
16:36.695 --> 16:38.905
A wonderful person like you...

270
16:40.135 --> 16:41.905
should have met a much better woman.

271
16:43.705 --> 16:45.305
How could someone so perfect...

272
16:46.975 --> 16:49.515
have such terrible taste in women?

273
16:52.115 --> 16:53.115
That is not true.

274
16:54.245 --> 16:55.885
In my entire life,

275
16:55.955 --> 16:58.155
the moment I want to praise myself the most...

276
16:58.585 --> 17:00.655
is the exact moment I met you.

277
17:06.125 --> 17:07.365
Answer it.

278
17:16.505 --> 17:18.875
Why? It might be urgent, so answer it.

279
17:20.805 --> 17:22.075
No, I...

280
17:24.045 --> 17:25.145
I do not need to answer it.

281
17:27.085 --> 17:28.715
You do not know if it is urgent.

282
17:32.655 --> 17:36.125
I almost forgot. I need to call Director Kim.

283
17:36.795 --> 17:37.795
Give me a second.

284
17:38.125 --> 17:39.525
You have not even finished your food.

285
17:39.595 --> 17:40.595
It is fine.

286
17:57.145 --> 17:59.285
Why are you not answering your phone?

287
17:59.485 --> 18:01.185
I sent you a message, but you are not even reading it.

288
18:03.885 --> 18:04.915
Why are you crying?

289
18:06.485 --> 18:08.455
Did something happen to the kids?

290
18:09.325 --> 18:11.825
What do we do? Honey. Our eldest son...

291
18:12.465 --> 18:14.825
Our Gyu Oh is a gigolo.

292
18:15.765 --> 18:20.535
He leeches off rich women. He is a gigolo. Our Gyu Oh.

293
18:25.575 --> 18:26.775
What did you just say?

294
18:28.875 --> 18:30.545
What did our Gyu Oh do?

295
18:53.905 --> 18:54.905
Hello.

296
18:57.535 --> 18:58.775
Yes, speaking.

297
18:59.945 --> 19:01.445
Is this Han Gyu Oh's phone?

298
19:03.945 --> 19:06.085
Yes, it is. Who is calling?

299
19:08.615 --> 19:11.215
Gyu Oh, it is Mom.

300
19:57.835 --> 19:58.865
I am Han Gyu Oh.

301
20:00.205 --> 20:01.305
Have you been well?

302
20:06.475 --> 20:07.475
Mom.

303
20:11.545 --> 20:13.315
Why did you have to live like that?

304
20:15.985 --> 20:18.455
Why did you have to live like that!

305
20:24.895 --> 20:26.265
Just because your mom left...

306
20:26.925 --> 20:27.925
and you didn't grow up with her,

307
20:27.995 --> 20:30.095
doesn't mean everyone lives like you.

308
20:32.935 --> 20:35.835
Even if they grew up in an unspeakably poor environment,

309
20:36.105 --> 20:39.005
even if their parents abandoned them.

310
20:39.575 --> 20:42.175
Even if they were raised by scum...

311
20:42.245 --> 20:43.815
who shouldn't even be called parents,

312
20:44.775 --> 20:47.085
there are countless kids out there...

313
20:47.145 --> 20:48.945
who grow up to be good, decent people.

314
21:08.705 --> 21:09.905
My Gyu Oh...

315
21:12.075 --> 21:15.175
My Gyu Oh was such a good kid.

316
21:16.015 --> 21:18.515
You were so kind, hardworking,

317
21:19.285 --> 21:23.485
upright, and honest.

318
21:25.925 --> 21:26.955
Why?

319
21:27.525 --> 21:32.095
You were such a wonderful kid. My Gyu Oh!

320
22:12.535 --> 22:14.905
I didn't hit you because I had the right to.

321
22:17.935 --> 22:19.175
How dare I...

322
22:24.345 --> 22:26.515
I know I have no right to do this to you...

323
22:26.515 --> 22:27.915
I know you must be embarrassed.

324
22:36.255 --> 22:37.925
I haven't lived a righteous life,

325
22:39.995 --> 22:42.195
but there was never a time when I didn't live diligently.

326
22:46.105 --> 22:48.065
That was true after you left,

327
22:49.275 --> 22:50.605
and it's true now.

328
22:52.875 --> 22:54.105
There hasn't been a single moment in my life...

329
22:54.205 --> 22:55.805
where I didn't do my absolute best.

330
22:59.245 --> 23:01.415
I worked myself to the bone, too.

331
23:28.205 --> 23:29.745
Anyway, I'm sorry.

332
23:31.915 --> 23:33.645
I'll live well from now on...

333
23:35.955 --> 23:37.215
so you won't have to worry.

334
23:43.295 --> 23:44.855
I'm sorry, Gyu Oh.

335
23:50.495 --> 23:51.495
Gyu Oh.

336
23:54.165 --> 23:55.805
I'm so, so sorry.

337
23:57.975 --> 24:00.705
Mom is so, so sorry, Gyu Oh.

338
24:51.555 --> 24:52.625
Su Chan.

339
24:55.865 --> 24:57.465
I'll accept your offer.

340
24:58.735 --> 25:00.305
The shares in the clothing store...

341
25:01.935 --> 25:02.975
Give me half.

342
25:07.345 --> 25:09.205
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

343
25:14.085 --> 25:16.815
One bottle of soju here, please.

344
25:29.295 --> 25:33.605
Why? Do I look familiar to you?

345
25:34.305 --> 25:35.565
How did you know?

346
25:35.965 --> 25:37.235
Actually, since the first time we met,

347
25:37.305 --> 25:39.975
I felt like you weren't a stranger.

348
25:43.115 --> 25:44.345
It's because...

349
25:47.315 --> 25:48.945
I have a friendly face.

350
25:49.685 --> 25:51.155
I mean, I've heard that I look like someone...

351
25:51.215 --> 25:53.955
so many times that my ears are bleeding.

352
25:54.025 --> 25:56.325
Want me to show you my bleeding ears?

353
25:56.595 --> 25:58.125
No, it's okay.

354
25:58.895 --> 25:59.995
Enjoy your meal.

355
26:05.965 --> 26:08.535
- Do you want a drink? - No, I'm fine.

356
26:08.705 --> 26:10.235
I'll pour it for you.

357
26:22.415 --> 26:24.085
Are you already married?

358
26:24.415 --> 26:26.985
Earlier, the old lady from the store across the street...

359
26:27.055 --> 26:29.355
called you someone's mom.

360
26:31.625 --> 26:33.895
I'm not married yet,

361
26:34.665 --> 26:36.165
but I do have a son.

362
26:37.635 --> 26:39.665
You're not married, but you have a son?

363
26:40.165 --> 26:44.105
- A single mom. - Yes, some people call it that.

364
26:44.375 --> 26:47.045
You're very confident, ma'am.

365
26:48.105 --> 26:50.375
There's no reason for me not to be.

366
26:52.745 --> 26:53.915
What about a boyfriend?

367
26:56.285 --> 26:58.915
- I have one. - You have a boyfriend, too?

368
26:59.655 --> 27:02.855
Wait, what does he do? Is he rich? What is his salary?

369
27:02.925 --> 27:05.755
Does he own a house? And what do his parents do?

370
27:10.335 --> 27:12.865
It is just that...

371
27:13.065 --> 27:17.935
Whenever I look at you, ma'am, I feel like an older sister to you.

372
27:18.835 --> 27:22.575
I feel as though you're my younger sister.

373
27:23.415 --> 27:26.845
I am totally overstepping, right? I am sorry.

374
27:27.345 --> 27:30.885
I love that man so very much.

375
27:31.885 --> 27:34.425
Just hearing his voice makes my heart flutter,

376
27:35.155 --> 27:37.955
and just hearing his footsteps makes me tremble.

377
27:38.995 --> 27:41.065
Even if he is not happy because of me,

378
27:41.795 --> 27:43.865
I am afraid he might become unhappy because of me.

379
27:44.465 --> 27:47.805
That always scares me.

380
27:49.335 --> 27:52.805
Right. I know what you mean,

381
27:53.005 --> 27:56.515
but realistically, a man who lives on overdrafts...

382
27:56.615 --> 27:58.215
and cannot even shop at a department store,

383
27:58.275 --> 28:00.645
you cannot possibly like a man like that.

384
28:02.085 --> 28:06.385
No matter what kind of person he is, I love him,

385
28:06.555 --> 28:08.655
respect him, and care for him.

386
28:09.255 --> 28:10.855
Even if he is a beggar?

387
28:11.355 --> 28:14.195
Yes. Even if he is an alien or an inanimate object.

388
28:15.095 --> 28:19.835
Even if he is lettuce, kimchi, or garlic.

389
28:27.645 --> 28:29.045
Are you seriously laughing?

390
28:30.745 --> 28:34.445
Yoon Jin called me, and she said you signed the waiver...

391
28:34.515 --> 28:35.915
for your inheritance and assets.

392
28:36.655 --> 28:40.755
- You are completely broke now. - Broke? Why am I broke?

393
28:40.925 --> 28:44.655
I have a healthy body and a job where I can work hard.

394
28:45.955 --> 28:48.565
I knew you were an idiot, but I never realised...

395
28:48.565 --> 28:52.135
you were this much of a hopeless idiot.

396
28:53.305 --> 28:57.135
Look at you smiling. I am calling you a stupid moron,

397
28:57.205 --> 29:00.805
- and you are just smiling. - I...

398
29:01.305 --> 29:02.945
am going to work really hard now.

399
29:03.445 --> 29:05.045
I will not slack off at all.

400
29:05.975 --> 29:07.485
I am really...

401
29:07.585 --> 29:10.155
- going to make a lot of money. - You better.

402
29:10.515 --> 29:12.855
You kicked away an astronomical amount of money,

403
29:12.925 --> 29:16.525
so you need to scrape together every single penny you can get.

404
29:16.595 --> 29:18.795
The group dinner reservation for 30 people is today, right?

405
29:20.065 --> 29:21.765
But they are not just regular customers.

406
29:21.825 --> 29:24.695
They set up cameras to eat, taste, and review everything.

407
29:25.165 --> 29:27.365
I heard they are very picky influencers.

408
29:29.065 --> 29:30.175
Man, move aside.

409
29:30.335 --> 29:31.475
This is no time to be standing around.

410
29:31.535 --> 29:34.475
Hey, you should at least finish your IV drip before you go.

411
29:36.005 --> 29:37.015
Let us go.

412
29:39.915 --> 29:42.545
He does not know the value of anything.

413
29:49.385 --> 29:50.595
Welcome.

414
30:05.205 --> 30:06.235
Oh my.

415
30:06.845 --> 30:08.745
Why are you two sitting separately?

416
30:09.505 --> 30:10.745
Did you have a fight?

417
30:12.775 --> 30:15.115
One bottle of soju and one bowl of kalguksu, please.

418
30:17.385 --> 30:18.755
One kalguksu.

419
30:40.545 --> 30:44.615
Things turning out this way is both your fault and mine.

420
30:45.415 --> 30:47.685
I will surely be punished for abandoning my child,

421
30:48.015 --> 30:49.245
so you too,

422
30:49.345 --> 30:51.585
the divine punishment for neglecting your child like that,

423
30:51.785 --> 30:53.285
make sure you face it.

424
30:59.355 --> 31:00.365
Here is your soju.

425
31:02.625 --> 31:03.665
What is wrong?

426
31:04.195 --> 31:05.195
I do not know.

427
31:38.435 --> 31:39.435
Why are you crying?

428
31:44.405 --> 31:45.975
I asked why you are crying.

429
31:46.945 --> 31:50.545
- Mind your own business. - How can I not care?

430
31:51.315 --> 31:53.045
When my friend who used to be as bright and pure as a child...

431
31:53.115 --> 31:54.545
is acting like it is the end of the world...

432
31:55.315 --> 31:56.515
and crying like this.

433
31:59.725 --> 32:00.725
Forget it.

434
32:02.355 --> 32:04.795
Friends? We decided not to be friends anymore.

435
32:05.855 --> 32:06.965
Seriously.

436
32:12.435 --> 32:13.435
Hey, you.

437
32:14.535 --> 32:15.535
Are you...

438
32:17.705 --> 32:19.005
Are you acting like this because you are hurt...

439
32:19.075 --> 32:20.875
that I rejected your proposal?

440
32:23.275 --> 32:24.275
No, I am not.

441
32:25.815 --> 32:27.815
It certainly looks like it.

442
32:29.015 --> 32:31.755
You are incredibly hurt that I rejected you.

443
32:32.285 --> 32:35.585
You are such a soft-hearted man.

444
32:37.525 --> 32:38.525
Go back to your seat.

445
32:39.295 --> 32:40.295
Today...

446
32:41.625 --> 32:42.665
I want to be alone.

447
32:45.095 --> 32:48.135
- My friend. - I said we are not friends.

448
32:48.205 --> 32:50.205
I do not make friends with women.

449
32:54.445 --> 32:55.545
Hong Ok Seon.

450
32:57.245 --> 32:58.245
Today,

451
32:58.415 --> 32:59.715
I deserve to receive divine punishment...

452
32:59.785 --> 33:01.185
with compound interest.

453
33:02.085 --> 33:03.955
You seem like a kind and good woman,

454
33:04.915 --> 33:06.985
so do not get hit by stones for standing next to a cruel guy.

455
33:07.055 --> 33:09.485
Just pass me by like a passing bus.

456
33:11.825 --> 33:12.895
In the distant future...

457
33:14.065 --> 33:17.965
If, before we die, we happen to meet again by chance,

458
33:19.595 --> 33:21.165
and if you are still...

459
33:22.065 --> 33:23.305
running a seafood restaurant then,

460
33:23.935 --> 33:25.705
buy me a plate of longtooth grouper.

461
33:37.685 --> 33:38.855
Now go back to your seat.

462
33:48.795 --> 33:51.165
Hey. Alright.

463
33:53.535 --> 33:55.935
Let us just not be friends then.

464
33:56.305 --> 33:58.605
What kind of friends can a man and a woman be anyway?

465
33:58.875 --> 34:00.145
Hey, whatever.

466
34:01.745 --> 34:03.145
Let us just have a fling starting today.

467
34:06.815 --> 34:07.845
But...

468
34:08.885 --> 34:10.815
I pursue platonic love.

469
34:11.785 --> 34:14.325
Physical affection only goes as far as holding hands.

470
34:15.085 --> 34:16.155
Do we have a deal if you agree?

471
34:20.095 --> 34:21.095
Deal?

472
34:23.665 --> 34:26.295
Darn it. Let go of me!

473
34:26.565 --> 34:31.075
Hey, you jerks. Do you have any idea who I am?

474
34:31.435 --> 34:35.205
I'm related to this company's chairman by marriage.

475
34:35.275 --> 34:37.475
My daughter-in-law is the chairman's daughter.

476
34:38.345 --> 34:40.015
If you do not let me in right now,

477
34:40.715 --> 34:42.885
I will have all of you fired.

478
34:43.555 --> 34:44.655
You cannot do this here.

479
34:44.715 --> 34:46.825
- Let go of this and let me in! - You cannot do this.

480
34:46.885 --> 34:48.355
It is fine, let her go.

481
34:53.565 --> 34:54.565
Do you know me?

482
34:55.425 --> 34:57.695
No, I do not.

483
34:59.365 --> 35:00.665
Are you someone important?

484
35:01.605 --> 35:02.935
I heard you are my mother-in-law.

485
35:05.005 --> 35:08.605
I am not even married yet, so where did you come from?

486
35:09.175 --> 35:10.915
Should I call the police and ask them?

487
35:11.675 --> 35:12.675
No.

488
35:13.445 --> 35:16.955
Not the police. Ask the chairman.

489
35:17.515 --> 35:21.055
If you tell him Han Gyu Young's mother-in-law is here, he will know.

490
35:21.685 --> 35:22.685
Han Gyu Young?

491
35:24.755 --> 35:26.155
That vacation home in Jeju,

492
35:26.665 --> 35:28.325
I am thinking of putting it up for a quick sale.

493
35:28.425 --> 35:30.165
(Chairman Jang Hoon Tae)

494
35:30.295 --> 35:31.465
Including all the land.

495
35:31.995 --> 35:33.465
No, it is not that.

496
35:34.165 --> 35:36.305
I personally need some urgent cash.

497
35:37.435 --> 35:38.435
Yes.

498
35:39.535 --> 35:40.545
Okay.

499
35:40.705 --> 35:43.545
Look into it and call me right back, yes.

500
35:45.515 --> 35:46.515
What is it?

501
35:48.045 --> 35:50.315
A woman named Shim Su Ji came to the lobby.

502
35:52.955 --> 35:54.985
She said she is the chairman's daughter's mother-in-law.

503
35:55.255 --> 35:56.285
Do you know her?

504
35:58.355 --> 35:59.395
Seo Hyun, that is...

505
35:59.595 --> 36:02.025
Yesterday, a man named Kang Sang Man came looking for you.

506
36:02.295 --> 36:03.635
And I heard...

507
36:03.695 --> 36:05.335
he claimed to be the chairman's daughter's father-in-law.

508
36:07.805 --> 36:09.005
It seems you know my in-laws very well,

509
36:09.005 --> 36:10.305
even though I do not know them.

510
36:10.875 --> 36:12.835
I also heard your shoulder was injured...

511
36:12.905 --> 36:13.975
while you were with Kang Sang Man.

512
36:22.945 --> 36:25.055
Send the person looking for me away, please.

513
36:34.695 --> 36:36.525
If it is Han Gyu Young, is she Han Gyu Rim's sister?

514
36:36.595 --> 36:37.595
Is she Mom's daughter, then?

515
36:38.735 --> 36:41.635
Have you two already been in touch with them?

516
36:43.035 --> 36:44.535
You must have met Han Gyu Rim too, then.

517
36:45.505 --> 36:46.505
Since when?

518
36:46.875 --> 36:48.345
Since when have you been lying to me?

519
36:48.405 --> 36:49.575
I never lied to you.

520
36:51.075 --> 36:52.075
Do not misunderstand.

521
36:52.715 --> 36:53.885
And your mom does not know.

522
36:56.585 --> 36:57.915
Your mom knows nothing.

523
36:58.655 --> 37:00.255
And I will make sure she never finds out,

524
37:01.555 --> 37:03.555
so just pretend you do not know about this and let it go.

525
37:03.695 --> 37:06.595
How can I pretend I do not know? You got hurt like this.

526
37:07.895 --> 37:10.335
It seems like you are being blackmailed by the people...

527
37:10.335 --> 37:12.095
claiming to be Han Gyu Young's in-laws.

528
37:15.635 --> 37:16.875
Should I dig into it myself?

529
37:18.075 --> 37:19.775
I do not care if Mom finds out or not.

530
37:20.175 --> 37:23.045
Should I hire a private investigator and dig into this until the end?

531
37:23.915 --> 37:24.915
Seo Hyun.

532
37:25.345 --> 37:27.585
Should I reach out to that girl, Han Gyu Young, directly?

533
37:28.045 --> 37:29.645
Should I demand to know who she thinks she is...

534
37:29.715 --> 37:32.655
- to make my dad suffer like this? - Why would you say it like that?

535
37:34.755 --> 37:37.595
If she is your mom's daughter, she is like a daughter to me, too.

536
37:39.955 --> 37:41.565
Just like you are Go Yoon Hee's daughter,

537
37:42.425 --> 37:44.165
Han Gyu Rim, Han Gyu Young...

538
37:44.965 --> 37:46.765
they are Jang Hoon Tae's daughters, just like you.

539
37:52.105 --> 37:53.105
They are.

540
37:57.745 --> 38:00.985
Did that jerk Kang Sung Wook not come to work today?

541
38:01.445 --> 38:02.515
He did not.

542
38:03.085 --> 38:04.455
Can you not just file...

543
38:04.515 --> 38:05.585
for a restraining order or something?

544
38:05.955 --> 38:08.055
Do you think I am not doing it because I do not know how?

545
38:08.855 --> 38:12.095
It is because of what I did. I have a guilty conscience.

546
38:12.595 --> 38:15.695
I am about to lose my mind.

547
38:17.035 --> 38:18.035
Hey, hang up.

548
38:28.075 --> 38:29.075
Big sister.

549
38:31.915 --> 38:35.215
I'm not your big sister! Do I look like your big sister?

550
38:35.785 --> 38:37.915
The family tree is completely messed up.

551
38:38.315 --> 38:40.255
So just go back to normal...

552
38:40.325 --> 38:41.355
and call me what you used to call me,

553
38:41.425 --> 38:44.625
- like "old lady" or something. - Old lady.

554
38:45.095 --> 38:46.295
No, not old lady.

555
38:46.595 --> 38:50.765
- Grandma. - Oh, Grandma.

556
38:53.805 --> 38:56.435
Hurry up and change your clothes. We have somewhere to go.

557
38:57.275 --> 39:01.905
- Where? Where are we going? - There is a shaman named Park.

558
39:01.975 --> 39:02.975
I need to ask her...

559
39:03.045 --> 39:04.475
how we can get you back to your senses...

560
39:07.115 --> 39:09.145
Would you even understand if I told you?

561
39:09.845 --> 39:12.585
Just hurry up, change your clothes, and follow me, okay?

562
39:12.855 --> 39:15.425
I do not want to go. I am scared.

563
39:15.725 --> 39:19.455
What is there to be scared of? I said let us go. Hurry.

564
39:19.725 --> 39:23.225
Grandma will buy you some candy, so hurry along, okay?

565
39:23.495 --> 39:26.795
No, I am scared. I am going back to my room.

566
39:27.365 --> 39:29.905
Do you think I am doing this because I have so much free time?

567
39:30.275 --> 39:33.235
I am trying to fix that broken head of yours.

568
39:33.235 --> 39:34.575
No, I am not going.

569
39:36.275 --> 39:38.815
If you keep disobeying Grandma,

570
39:39.645 --> 39:42.645
Roar. I will tell the tiger to come and get you.

571
39:43.885 --> 39:46.085
I do not think I am scared of tigers.

572
39:47.825 --> 39:49.525
You are not scared of tigers?

573
39:51.525 --> 39:52.525
Right.

574
39:53.325 --> 39:54.325
This is not working.

575
39:54.395 --> 39:56.595
Try releasing a snake, and see if I follow you.

576
39:57.165 --> 39:58.965
A long tail is bound to be stepped on,

577
39:59.265 --> 40:01.505
and if you commit a crime, you must be punished.

578
40:02.865 --> 40:05.935
I should just call the person she hates the most,

579
40:06.735 --> 40:10.045
her father, and try some shock therapy.

580
40:10.375 --> 40:11.375
Let me see.

581
40:11.975 --> 40:13.585
Gyeol's grandfather's number is...

582
40:13.815 --> 40:15.445
I will change my clothes and be right out, Grandma.

583
40:18.955 --> 40:21.685
Buy me seasoned fried chicken instead of candy.

584
40:26.195 --> 40:29.165
Did the shock therapy work or what?

585
40:32.065 --> 40:33.065
Let us go.

586
40:34.035 --> 40:36.865
We need to hurry. I am busy today too.

587
40:37.875 --> 40:42.175
Meeting a guy like that messed her up...

588
40:42.245 --> 40:43.715
and everything...

589
40:49.945 --> 40:51.185
They said room 302, right?

590
40:53.115 --> 40:54.185
Hey, playboy.

591
41:00.265 --> 41:02.165
And paranoid husband.

592
41:05.165 --> 41:06.395
What brings you to my house?

593
41:07.165 --> 41:08.235
Are you here looking for Gyu Young?

594
41:08.865 --> 41:09.935
Gyu Young is here, right?

595
41:10.935 --> 41:11.935
She is not.

596
41:12.005 --> 41:13.075
Should I go in and search the place?

597
41:13.905 --> 41:15.105
What will you do if I find her?

598
41:16.675 --> 41:18.275
What will you do if you search and do not find her?

599
41:18.575 --> 41:20.075
I know she is here.

600
41:23.855 --> 41:25.655
Then let us record this as evidence.

601
41:26.815 --> 41:29.725
If you search and Gyu Young is not here,

602
41:30.595 --> 41:32.355
including your implants,

603
41:32.895 --> 41:34.865
even if I make you wear full dentures,

604
41:35.125 --> 41:36.895
you will not raise any objections.

605
41:38.635 --> 41:39.835
I am recording from now on.

606
41:43.205 --> 41:44.705
If you search my house...

607
41:45.275 --> 41:47.645
and Gyu Young is here, I will stand at ease...

608
41:47.705 --> 41:49.245
and take every hit you give me.

609
41:50.045 --> 41:51.415
If Gyu Young is not here...

610
41:57.155 --> 41:58.855
Did I say she was definitely here?

611
42:00.215 --> 42:02.355
I just guessed she might be.

612
42:03.755 --> 42:04.825
Just because you are a little taller,

613
42:04.895 --> 42:09.425
you keep looking down on me, so I must look like an easy target.

614
42:09.765 --> 42:11.665
Since you cannot even live up to your height anyway,

615
42:11.735 --> 42:13.935
let us take this chance to match our heights.

616
42:16.335 --> 42:17.475
What are you saying?

617
42:19.405 --> 42:21.975
If you search and Gyu Young is not here,

618
42:22.405 --> 42:24.815
I will either fold Kang Sung Wook's spine...

619
42:25.245 --> 42:29.085
or break his legs to match his size with Jo Heung Sik.

620
42:30.815 --> 42:31.915
Say, "I agree."

621
42:33.925 --> 42:35.155
What? Are you a psychopath?

622
42:37.425 --> 42:39.225
This is truly shocking.

623
42:39.655 --> 42:42.925
Jo Heung Sik, were you always this terrible of a person?

624
42:47.835 --> 42:49.665
Gosh, Jo Heung Sik.

625
42:59.745 --> 43:02.445
I was so scared he would actually search my house.

626
43:05.815 --> 43:07.255
My blood sausage is all cold. Darn it.

627
43:08.185 --> 43:11.725
Evil spirits, be gone.

628
43:13.555 --> 43:18.295
Be gone, evil spirits, be gone.

629
43:18.365 --> 43:23.105
Be gone. Evil spirits, be gone.

630
43:24.535 --> 43:29.045
You wicked evil spirit, be gone completely.

631
43:29.275 --> 43:32.815
Oh, spirits.

632
43:33.475 --> 43:35.185
Please look after...

633
43:35.345 --> 43:38.715
this pitiful soul.

634
43:50.265 --> 43:51.265
Who are you?

635
43:54.665 --> 43:56.835
I am asking who you are. What is your name?

636
44:00.945 --> 44:03.575
How dare you in front of the spirits.

637
44:04.615 --> 44:06.845
You wicked thing.

638
44:10.385 --> 44:12.255
Spirits.

639
44:47.455 --> 44:49.525
I'm here, so why are you not even looking?

640
44:50.695 --> 44:53.025
Sorry. I did not know you were here.

641
44:54.865 --> 44:56.195
You are here earlier than I thought.

642
44:56.325 --> 44:57.395
We had shortened classes today.

643
44:58.435 --> 44:59.495
But why the bookstore?

644
45:02.965 --> 45:04.435
These are past GED questions, right?

645
45:06.675 --> 45:07.675
Are you going to take the GED?

646
45:09.975 --> 45:11.775
Teach me how to study, Hee Na.

647
45:13.015 --> 45:14.585
Out of all the students you have taught,

648
45:14.645 --> 45:16.015
I will make you feel the most rewarded.

649
45:18.185 --> 45:21.285
When I was in school, I was in the top five of my class.

650
45:23.485 --> 45:24.495
Oh my.

651
45:25.125 --> 45:27.465
I am so touched that I am about to cry.

652
45:30.895 --> 45:32.695
No, but how do you solve this?

653
45:34.065 --> 45:35.405
Including the absolute value...

654
45:51.485 --> 45:53.285
This is "The mother's dream".

655
45:53.555 --> 45:55.125
It is a poem called "A Mother's Dream."

656
45:55.755 --> 45:58.325
You have to choose the prepositions that go into A and B.

657
45:59.825 --> 46:01.825
First, do you want to try translating...

658
46:01.895 --> 46:03.195
the sentence where A belongs?

659
46:08.365 --> 46:09.365
The child...

660
46:10.835 --> 46:12.335
that I had...

661
46:14.405 --> 46:17.575
but could not raise.

662
46:20.145 --> 46:21.315
Good job.

663
46:22.315 --> 46:26.115
Then what is the preposition that goes before "keep" here?

664
46:30.285 --> 46:31.295
To?

665
46:32.425 --> 46:34.225
You are driving me crazy, my boyfriend.

666
46:34.425 --> 46:35.665
Why are you so smart?

667
46:36.195 --> 46:37.735
Your teacher has nothing left to teach you.

668
46:39.335 --> 46:43.135
Then do you want to try translating the sentence where B belongs too?

669
46:49.475 --> 46:51.815
It is okay if you are wrong. Anyone can make a mistake.

670
46:55.085 --> 46:57.315
It would have been better if we had met a little later.

671
46:58.785 --> 46:59.785
What?

672
47:00.055 --> 47:02.425
It would have been better if we had met...

673
47:04.995 --> 47:06.555
after I became a little more wonderful.

674
47:08.525 --> 47:10.795
Who? Me?

675
47:13.565 --> 47:17.035
You are cool and wonderful enough, Han Gyu Oh.

676
47:18.135 --> 47:20.845
I am still so in love with you that I do not know what to do,

677
47:21.175 --> 47:22.645
so how much more wonderful do you plan to be?

678
47:29.345 --> 47:30.715
I met my mother today.

679
47:31.055 --> 47:32.055
Really?

680
47:38.155 --> 47:40.295
I did not know I would meet her this fast,

681
47:41.865 --> 47:43.125
but I met her too early.

682
47:44.465 --> 47:46.595
Of all times, when I am at my worst and most pathetic,

683
47:47.705 --> 47:48.705
when I am...

684
47:50.205 --> 47:51.605
the most embarrassed and ashamed.

685
47:54.405 --> 47:55.645
Past tense.

686
47:57.145 --> 47:59.815
That is past tense, not present tense.

687
48:03.385 --> 48:05.815
What kind of dream did my mother have for me?

688
48:08.725 --> 48:10.485
What kind of person did she want me to become?

689
48:12.025 --> 48:13.995
What kind of person did she want me to live as?

690
48:31.445 --> 48:32.715
When on earth did you take this?

691
48:33.075 --> 48:34.885
Yesterday, before we met the lady,

692
48:35.115 --> 48:37.045
when you were on your phone with Dae Woong.

693
48:38.255 --> 48:39.255
Why did you take this?

694
48:39.755 --> 48:41.685
Just in case Gyu Rim...

695
48:41.755 --> 48:43.185
wanted to see it, I wanted to show her.

696
48:43.825 --> 48:46.095
It is our mother's face, so we should not forget it.

697
48:46.155 --> 48:47.155
No.

698
48:47.325 --> 48:49.095
We cannot get caught meeting that lady yet.

699
48:50.065 --> 48:52.195
That is why I said just in case.

700
48:52.565 --> 48:54.205
She said they have not seen each other for 17 years.

701
48:54.565 --> 48:55.565
If she gets older,

702
48:55.635 --> 48:57.305
she might not recognise her even right in front of her.

703
48:57.365 --> 48:58.375
Look at separated families.

704
49:03.275 --> 49:06.675
But do you not think the area around the ears...

705
49:06.745 --> 49:07.815
looks a bit similar to that lady?

706
49:09.015 --> 49:11.885
- Why would that lady look like us? - Look closely.

707
49:12.555 --> 49:14.425
Her eyebrows look exactly like yours.

708
49:15.355 --> 49:19.955
Sure. Maybe our toes look alike too.

709
49:20.125 --> 49:23.395
Do you not think her smile looks a bit like mine?

710
49:25.465 --> 49:26.465
Let us stop, Han Gyu Seo.

711
49:27.665 --> 49:28.935
Han Gyu Seo.

712
49:30.775 --> 49:32.535
What is this? You two happen to be together.

713
49:33.275 --> 49:36.445
Some lady told me to give this to Han Gyu Seo or Han Gyu Min.

714
49:36.445 --> 49:37.775
- Which lady? Who? - Which lady? Who?

715
49:38.575 --> 49:39.575
I do not know.

716
49:39.715 --> 49:41.115
I met her in front of the school gate.

717
49:41.785 --> 49:43.315
Any other twins named Han Gyu Seo and Han Gyu Min...

718
49:43.385 --> 49:44.455
at our school besides you two?

719
49:45.215 --> 49:46.215
What are you doing? Take it.

720
49:46.955 --> 49:48.185
- What is that? - What is that?

721
49:48.185 --> 49:49.685
How should I know?

722
49:49.785 --> 49:50.995
Hurry up. I have to go to the bathroom.

723
49:51.055 --> 49:52.055
Okay.

724
49:53.225 --> 49:54.865
What is this? Is it from a fan?

725
49:57.865 --> 50:02.235
There is something bulky inside. And a letter, too.

726
50:02.305 --> 50:03.835
- Give it here. - It really must be from a fan.

727
50:13.145 --> 50:15.145
To my beloved son and daughter,

728
50:15.645 --> 50:17.115
Gyu Seo and Gyu Min.

729
50:18.055 --> 50:21.125
Why? Is it that crazy stalker from last time?

730
50:21.525 --> 50:24.195
Kids, it has been a really long time.

731
50:26.125 --> 50:27.665
Hey, Han Gyu Seo...

732
50:28.095 --> 50:31.595
I am your mom.

733
50:34.405 --> 50:35.605
I carried you for ten months.

734
50:35.665 --> 50:38.805
The mother who went through so much to carry and give birth to you.

735
50:41.145 --> 50:44.105
I missed you both so much...

736
50:44.175 --> 50:46.315
that I stayed up crying every single night.

737
50:46.975 --> 50:48.585
Missing you so much...

738
50:49.415 --> 50:51.755
made it feel like I was not even living.

739
50:53.915 --> 50:55.725
Since you are both all grown up now,

740
50:55.955 --> 50:59.025
I believe you will understand and forgive me.

741
50:59.955 --> 51:01.125
The enclosed money...

742
51:01.195 --> 51:04.095
is my way of apologising to you.

743
51:04.895 --> 51:07.705
Anything you have wanted to have...

744
51:07.765 --> 51:10.135
or buy all this time, go ahead and buy it.

745
51:11.205 --> 51:14.275
I am always watching over you.

746
51:15.305 --> 51:18.115
I will wait for the day we can meet soon.

747
51:18.915 --> 51:22.315
From the mother who loves you more than anything in the world.

748
51:22.585 --> 51:23.645
Mom.

749
51:27.185 --> 51:28.355
Where are you?

750
51:28.925 --> 51:31.795
Come out. Come out right now.

751
51:34.695 --> 51:36.025
What do you mean, Mom?

752
51:36.825 --> 51:38.535
How dare you call yourself our mom?

753
51:40.035 --> 51:41.565
Come out right now, take this, and get lost.

754
51:42.105 --> 51:45.075
We do not need this garbage, so take it and get lost.

755
51:46.835 --> 51:48.705
What do you mean, Mom?

756
51:49.575 --> 51:52.345
We do not need a mother like you, so just get lost!

757
51:53.175 --> 51:56.385
Han Gyu Seo, stop it, please. Stop it.

758
51:56.885 --> 51:59.185
Gyu Seo, stop it.

759
52:00.555 --> 52:03.325
Stop. Stop it and let's go inside.

760
52:03.855 --> 52:05.025
Do you want the whole school and world...

761
52:05.095 --> 52:08.865
to know that our mom abandoned us and ran away to have an affair?

762
52:10.895 --> 52:12.465
What if Gyu Rim finds out?

763
52:13.135 --> 52:15.465
What if the rumours spread and Gyu Rim hears about it?

764
52:15.665 --> 52:16.865
Please, let's go inside.

765
52:19.035 --> 52:20.475
Let's go.

766
52:22.875 --> 52:25.645
(Seonghan High School)

767
52:45.165 --> 52:47.635
Darn it, Han Seok Joong.

768
52:48.365 --> 52:50.805
How on earth did you raise my son?

769
52:51.205 --> 52:53.405
Why is he acting like such a thug?

770
52:54.005 --> 52:57.175
He looks like he is ready to eat his own mother alive.

771
53:16.425 --> 53:18.795
Are you crazy? Why are you throwing away money?

772
53:19.295 --> 53:20.865
Why would you accept money from that woman?

773
53:22.065 --> 53:23.435
Does the money have her name written on it?

774
53:23.505 --> 53:24.505
If you do not want it, forget it.

775
53:24.575 --> 53:25.975
Because I am going to keep it all for myself.

776
53:26.035 --> 53:28.005
Han Gyu Min, bring that back right now.

777
53:28.075 --> 53:30.605
Half of it is mine. Then give me my half.

778
53:30.675 --> 53:32.545
I am just taking the money, but I will not forgive her.

779
53:32.615 --> 53:33.845
And I will not accept her as my mother, either.

780
53:33.915 --> 53:35.815
She gave it to us, so I will do whatever I want with it.

781
53:35.885 --> 53:36.885
Why?

782
53:51.195 --> 53:52.295
Do you want to take a look at this?

783
53:52.365 --> 53:53.365
Yes.

784
53:55.405 --> 53:57.535
- Is the temperature okay? - Yes.

785
53:58.435 --> 54:01.005
This is so nice. It is really warm.

786
54:01.345 --> 54:02.745
It feels good and toasty, right?

787
54:02.945 --> 54:05.375
People with poor blood circulation buy this a lot,

788
54:05.475 --> 54:07.445
so it is the most popular product in our store.

789
54:07.515 --> 54:10.015
- Really? - Yes.

790
54:10.085 --> 54:12.215
Hey, Han Gyu Seo, I think this is pretty good.

791
54:12.555 --> 54:13.855
Your father...

792
54:14.115 --> 54:16.125
comes here to warm up whenever he has free time.

793
54:16.185 --> 54:17.895
He says it makes his body feel nice and hot.

794
54:17.955 --> 54:20.295
Actually, your father really wanted this product,

795
54:20.425 --> 54:23.025
- so he will probably love it. - It is not for our father.

796
54:23.895 --> 54:25.335
Then is it for Gyu Rim?

797
54:25.765 --> 54:26.765
Yes.

798
54:27.365 --> 54:30.235
Are you two really going to give this to her as a gift?

799
54:31.375 --> 54:34.075
Yes. A bunch of money...

800
54:34.235 --> 54:36.745
- suddenly fell from the sky. - Wait...

801
54:37.945 --> 54:40.875
- Did you win the lottery? - Yes.

802
54:41.885 --> 54:44.815
But you must never tell our dad about this.

803
54:46.415 --> 54:47.515
By the way,

804
54:48.425 --> 54:51.695
if we give it, our oldest sister will not accept it.

805
54:51.695 --> 54:53.755
Is there any way around that?

806
54:57.895 --> 55:00.195
Do not ask me to use my brain.

807
55:01.235 --> 55:04.405
A ticking time bomb just rolled into my house,

808
55:04.505 --> 55:06.605
so my head is already about to explode as it is.

809
55:08.045 --> 55:09.105
What should we do?

810
55:09.305 --> 55:11.415
Coming up with tricks is our dad's specialty.

811
55:11.475 --> 55:13.515
But we cannot exactly ask him about this.

812
55:13.915 --> 55:14.915
Right.

813
55:18.255 --> 55:20.215
What? What did you win?

814
55:20.615 --> 55:24.055
Mom, he won a heating mat. A mat.

815
55:26.395 --> 55:28.465
The department store is giving away prizes...

816
55:28.525 --> 55:29.665
for its 300-year anniversary.

817
55:30.065 --> 55:32.565
Not 300 years. It is only 30 years.

818
55:32.635 --> 55:34.165
Right, 30 years.

819
55:34.235 --> 55:36.035
Yes, anyway, Gyu Seo entered the raffle...

820
55:36.105 --> 55:38.235
- and he won. - Awesome.

821
55:40.375 --> 55:43.045
Congratulations, Gyu Seo. I have never seen anyone I know...

822
55:43.205 --> 55:45.715
- win something like this before. - Me neither.

823
55:45.775 --> 55:47.215
I have never seen anyone I know...

824
55:47.275 --> 55:49.215
win something like this before, either.

825
55:50.085 --> 55:52.515
Anyway, I want to give it to you.

826
55:53.485 --> 55:55.225
- Me? - Yes.

827
55:55.285 --> 55:56.755
You work so hard,

828
55:56.825 --> 55:58.825
and he did not buy it with money, he won it.

829
55:58.895 --> 56:01.095
- Take it, Gyu Rim. - Take it, Mom.

830
56:01.825 --> 56:03.895
I am fine. I am still young.

831
56:03.995 --> 56:05.865
- Give it to Dad. - Absolutely not.

832
56:06.395 --> 56:09.105
It will be delivered soon, so do not say a word to Dad.

833
56:09.505 --> 56:11.175
- Gyu Seo. - Dad should not be home right now.

834
56:11.235 --> 56:12.405
He will take it right away.

835
56:13.005 --> 56:15.205
Gyu Min. Father is in there.

836
56:29.425 --> 56:30.425
Father.

837
56:31.855 --> 56:33.225
You should have it.

838
56:34.195 --> 56:35.265
I am fine.

839
56:35.325 --> 56:36.965
Of course you should be the one to use it.

840
56:38.235 --> 56:40.865
That is yours. You use it.

841
56:40.935 --> 56:41.965
(Happy Ramyeon)

842
56:42.035 --> 56:43.965
You had the hardest time in our family.

843
56:44.635 --> 56:46.075
Even when Mom abandoned us,

844
56:46.205 --> 56:48.005
you fed us milk, changed our diapers,

845
56:48.345 --> 56:49.975
carried us, dressed us, put us to sleep,

846
56:50.045 --> 56:51.175
and worked to earn money.

847
56:51.845 --> 56:53.615
You suffered the most in our family.

848
56:54.045 --> 56:55.845
(Happy Ramyeon)

849
56:55.915 --> 56:57.415
Would you like to say a word, Father?

850
57:00.015 --> 57:01.625
Tell them you had a hard time living, too.

851
57:02.585 --> 57:03.625
That you may not have done a great job,

852
57:03.685 --> 57:04.895
but you still tried your best.

853
57:05.255 --> 57:06.325
That you could have abandoned us...

854
57:06.395 --> 57:08.195
and started a new life on your own,

855
57:08.265 --> 57:10.195
but at least you did not do something that terrible.

856
57:11.335 --> 57:12.695
Especially when the twins...

857
57:13.095 --> 57:14.965
had a high fever and were on the verge of dying.

858
57:15.035 --> 57:18.175
You carried both of them from night until dawn,

859
57:18.235 --> 57:20.135
running around to 20 different hospitals...

860
57:21.075 --> 57:23.375
and barely saved their lives. You should tell them that.

861
57:23.675 --> 57:26.515
(Happy Ramyeon)

862
57:26.575 --> 57:27.675
I did that?

863
57:31.555 --> 57:32.955
When was that?

864
57:34.755 --> 57:36.255
When the twins were four years old.

865
57:36.385 --> 57:37.385
Back then?

866
57:37.925 --> 57:40.755
That is right. I remember now.

867
57:40.995 --> 57:43.665
Yes. Right, I saved the kids.

868
57:43.965 --> 57:46.395
Yes, I saved the twins.

869
57:46.765 --> 57:50.205
As a father, I did do something for my children.

870
57:51.165 --> 57:52.175
Yes.

871
57:54.605 --> 57:55.645
Right.

872
57:55.645 --> 57:57.645
(Han Gyu Seo)

873
57:59.075 --> 58:01.075
(Han Gyu Min)

874
58:07.915 --> 58:09.225
Hey.

875
58:11.295 --> 58:12.755
I am going to work my part-time job.

876
58:12.825 --> 58:14.825
Hey, twins, you should stay and listen to more.

877
58:15.095 --> 58:17.595
Why are you just leaving? Oh, man.

878
58:18.765 --> 58:20.965
You should have told that wonderful story earlier.

879
58:21.035 --> 58:22.365
Why are you only bringing it up now?

880
58:23.105 --> 58:25.305
I am sorry, I just suddenly remembered it too.

881
58:25.505 --> 58:27.375
Keep thinking hard.

882
58:27.575 --> 58:30.145
There might be other good things that I have done.

883
58:30.245 --> 58:32.415
There could be more hidden good deeds.

884
58:33.275 --> 58:34.275
Okay.

885
58:35.245 --> 58:38.015
Gyeol, you are completely touched by your grandpa, right?

886
58:38.685 --> 58:39.685
Yes.

887
58:39.785 --> 58:41.115
You totally respect me now, do you not?

888
58:41.585 --> 58:43.155
I was just touched.

889
58:43.655 --> 58:45.855
You are definitely your mother's son.

890
58:47.225 --> 58:50.195
I will proudly accept the prize, then.

891
58:51.165 --> 58:52.165
Yes.

892
58:55.665 --> 58:57.235
They must be here.

893
58:59.675 --> 59:01.005
The installation is all done.

894
59:01.375 --> 59:02.745
Yes, thank you.

895
59:03.075 --> 59:05.045
Please contact us anytime if you have any questions.

896
59:05.215 --> 59:06.845
- Okay. - Yes, take care.

897
59:06.915 --> 59:08.845
- Yes, thank you. - Goodbye.

898
59:08.915 --> 59:11.115
Thank you for your hard work. Please have some coffee.

899
59:15.155 --> 59:19.255
Right, it is you. They say wishes come true,

900
59:19.755 --> 59:23.195
and we finally met. Beautiful.

901
59:23.725 --> 59:27.765
Like this. This is nice.

902
59:29.135 --> 59:32.805
My stressed and aching body is just melting away, melting away.

903
59:33.875 --> 59:35.875
(Suragan Side Dishes)

904
59:42.645 --> 59:43.745
Yes, Gyu Min.

905
59:44.545 --> 59:45.715
Gyu Rim, what should I do?

906
59:47.055 --> 59:48.385
What is wrong? What happened?

907
59:48.955 --> 59:51.495
The employees at our restaurant all disappeared.

908
59:52.355 --> 59:53.395
Except for me...

909
59:53.455 --> 59:55.725
No, except for me, Mu Jin, and the CEO.

910
59:56.095 --> 59:57.925
The kitchen chefs, the assistants,

911
59:58.235 --> 01:00:01.295
and the part-time servers, they all vanished at once.

912
01:00:01.295 --> 01:00:02.465
Without a word.

913
01:00:02.965 --> 01:00:04.135
What do you mean?

914
01:00:40.205 --> 01:00:41.275
Mu Jin,

915
01:00:41.575 --> 01:00:43.175
this is not going to work. Let us just close up.

916
01:00:43.575 --> 01:00:44.815
How can you do all this by yourself?

917
01:00:44.875 --> 01:00:47.615
- We are even fully booked today. - How can we turn away customers...

918
01:00:47.675 --> 01:00:50.445
who even made reservations? I will try my best to handle it.

919
01:00:50.645 --> 01:00:53.085
You are not a Black and White Chef, you absolutely cannot do this alone.

920
01:00:53.355 --> 01:00:55.085
Even a Black and White Chef could not do this.

921
01:00:55.685 --> 01:00:57.055
- Darn it. - Mu Jin.

922
01:00:59.125 --> 01:01:00.655
Hey, bring me some bandages and antiseptic.

923
01:01:00.725 --> 01:01:01.865
Darn it.

924
01:01:18.275 --> 01:01:21.515
Regarding your future employment, you do not need to worry.

925
01:01:22.145 --> 01:01:24.385
Inside the envelope, you will find three business cards.

926
01:01:24.485 --> 01:01:26.555
Out of the three places, you can go to the one you want...

927
01:01:26.615 --> 01:01:29.455
and work there. The salary and conditions...

928
01:01:29.755 --> 01:01:31.895
will be much better than your previous job.

929
01:01:33.255 --> 01:01:34.525
A guilty conscience...

930
01:01:35.065 --> 01:01:36.365
is not something you need to feel.

931
01:01:36.895 --> 01:01:39.895
In the end, you will see that you are actually helping the chef.

932
01:01:42.705 --> 01:01:45.535
You are preparing well for the next step, right?

933
01:02:05.125 --> 01:02:06.125
What?

934
01:02:06.295 --> 01:02:08.025
How far are you going to take this?

935
01:02:08.765 --> 01:02:10.265
Just as you wanted, you took everything...

936
01:02:10.325 --> 01:02:12.065
away from Mu Jin.

937
01:02:13.435 --> 01:02:15.265
Mu Jin still has a lot.

938
01:02:17.165 --> 01:02:19.275
Are you really trying to make him completely penniless?

939
01:02:19.535 --> 01:02:20.935
Only when he hits rock bottom...

940
01:02:21.705 --> 01:02:24.875
will his true colours, his true intentions be revealed.

941
01:02:26.875 --> 01:02:28.615
Are you testing Han Gyu Rim?

942
01:02:29.285 --> 01:02:30.345
To see if her feelings will not change...

943
01:02:30.415 --> 01:02:34.015
- even if Mu Jin becomes a beggar? - Hey, just pick one.

944
01:02:34.485 --> 01:02:37.485
Either play the good sister, or the ambitious sister.

945
01:02:37.885 --> 01:02:39.255
If you are going to be the good sister,

946
01:02:39.725 --> 01:02:40.895
you are out, too.

947
01:02:44.825 --> 01:02:46.195
Just once.

948
01:02:46.735 --> 01:02:48.035
Please help me out just this once.

949
01:02:48.095 --> 01:02:50.205
Do you think I would have called you if I were not desperate?

950
01:02:54.605 --> 01:02:56.805
Your place is not doing well anyway, right?

951
01:02:57.175 --> 01:02:59.115
Can you not just close for today and help out?

952
01:02:59.315 --> 01:03:00.815
What about our Mu Jin?

953
01:03:01.145 --> 01:03:03.245
He closed his restaurant for a week to help you.

954
01:03:03.245 --> 01:03:04.785
You shameless jerk.

955
01:03:05.515 --> 01:03:07.985
It is a waste of time to even curse at you. Get lost.

956
01:03:17.295 --> 01:03:18.865
Do you have an extra chef uniform?

957
01:03:19.495 --> 01:03:21.535
- Gyu Rim. - Gyu Rim.

958
01:03:54.695 --> 01:03:57.935
Hey, I think you are right. I do not think I can do this alone.

959
01:03:59.335 --> 01:04:01.675
That is why I am here.

960
01:04:11.685 --> 01:04:12.685
Gyu Rim.

961
01:04:14.015 --> 01:04:15.555
You know I am good at cooking, right?

962
01:04:16.285 --> 01:04:17.485
I will help you.

963
01:05:09.145 --> 01:05:10.675
(Love on the Menu)

964
01:05:10.745 --> 01:05:13.045
- How does my mom know Han Gyu Oh? - Han Gyu Oh?

965
01:05:13.045 --> 01:05:15.545
- Is Han Gyu Oh a gigolo? - It is okay, Gyu Oh.

966
01:05:15.615 --> 01:05:16.785
As long as Gyu Rim does not find out.

967
01:05:16.845 --> 01:05:18.515
Right, as long as Gyu Rim does not find out.

968
01:05:18.585 --> 01:05:21.355
- Brace yourself before you look. - We asked for too little.

969
01:05:21.415 --> 01:05:23.925
- Just give us ten million dollars. - Go ahead and sue me.

970
01:05:23.985 --> 01:05:25.725
Why on earth is he doing this to you?

971
01:05:25.725 --> 01:05:26.725
Why did you do it?

972
01:05:26.725 --> 01:05:28.725
Gyu Rim, this is the end.

973
01:05:29.665 --> 01:05:30.765
It is over now.

974
01:05:31.265 --> 01:05:34.495
Hello, I have a promise to make to you, Mu Jin.
